            "id": 390,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vered3Na6o2hqlxuxZnliOoRgjf\">Regarding the remaining countries, Germany and India started at about 400 and 200 megawatts respectively in 1985. German production increased gradually to around 900 megawatts by the end of the period. India showed a similar pattern of growth, though at a slower pace, reaching approximately 1200 megawatts in 2000.</div>\n</div>",
